title: 福利政策Social welfare policy
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
on-arrival: social_welfare_timer = 10; month_actions += 1
view-if: spd_in_government = 1 and social_welfare_timer = 0
card-image: img/portraits/JuchaczMarie.jpg

= 福利政策

失业保险、医疗以及养老等社会福利政策是社民党在执政期间最为骄傲的成就。[? if black_thursday_seen = 1 :特别是在经济危机的背景下， ?]要求废除福利制度的压力持续不断。

- @reduce_spending: 减少福利支出。Reduce spending on welfare.
- @increase_spending_pre_depression: 增加福利支出。Increase spending on welfare.
- @increase_spending_post_depression: 增加福利支出（实际福利水平基本会维持不变）。
- @spending_same_pre_depression: 维持当前福利支出。Keep spending the same.
- @spending_same_post_depression: 维持当前福利支出（实际福利水平会下降）。
- @easy_discard

@reduce_spending
subtitle: 此举会损害我们的无产阶级票仓。+1预算
on-arrival: budget += 1; workers_spd -= 6; unemployed_spd -= 6; workers_kpd += 3; welfare -= 1; reformist_dissent += 10; left_dissent += 10; labor_dissent += 10; center_dissent += 5; neorevisionist_dissent += 5; dvp_relation += 5; z_relation += 3; pro_republic -= 3; coalition_dissent -= 1 if in_grand_coalition; kpd_coalition_dissent += 1; kpd_relation -= 8; inflation -= 0.3

我们减少了社会福利支出，这意味着工人阶级会遭受更多的贫困和苦难。我们的批评者声称，为了和资产阶级实现阶级和平，我们牺牲了无产阶级的生计。他们错了吗？鉴于我们的选择，那些转向共产党的工人们错了吗？


@increase_spending_pre_depression
view-if: unemployed <= 15
choose-if: budget > 0
subtitle: -1 Budget
on-arrival: budget -= 1; workers_spd += 6*(1-dissent); unemployed_spd += 6*(1-dissent); welfare += 1; reformist_dissent -= 5; labor_dissent -= 5; center_dissent -= 5; left_dissent -= 5; neorevisionist_dissent -= 5; coalition_dissent += 1 if welfare > 1; welfare_goal_completed += 1; inflation += 0.3

我们增加了福利支出。我们的无产阶级票仓很满意。

@increase_spending_post_depression
view-if: unemployed > 15
choose-if: budget > 0
on-arrival: budget -= 1; workers_spd += 3*(1-dissent); unemployed_spd += 3*(1-dissent); coalition_dissent += 1 if welfare > 0; welfare_goal_completed += 1; inflation += 0.3
subtitle: 由于失业率上升，维持同样的福利水平必须增加福利支出。-1预算

鉴于失业率上升就必须增加福利支出，因此我们基本上是在“踩水”。

@spending_same_pre_depression
view-if: unemployed <= 15

我们维持当前福利支出不变。


@spending_same_post_depression
view-if: unemployed > 15
on-arrival: workers_spd -= 3; unemployed_spd -= 4; welfare -= 1; reformist_dissent += 5; left_dissent += 5; labor_dissent += 5; center_dissent += 5; neorevisionist_dissent += 5; kpd_coalition_dissent += 1; kpd_relation -= 8 if in_popular_front or in_left_front
subtitle: 由于失业率上升，维持同样的福利水平必须增加福利支出。

鉴于失业率上升就必须增加福利支出，所以我们实际上削减了福利水平。工人很不高兴，这也情有可原——我们为了满足资产阶级的紧缩要求牺牲了他们的生计。

[? if in_popular_front or in_left_front: 共产党反对我们的福利政策。 ?]
